{"id":"dedo","lemma":"dedo","pos":"noun","rank":1110,"glosses":["digit: finger or toe, literally translated as \"finger\" and thought of that way by Spanish-speaking learners of English","thimble (a small device to protect a thumb or finger during sewing)","finger (the width of a finger as an approximate unit of length)"],"ipa":"/ˈdedo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dedos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dedo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Ten cuidado con los dedos!","en":"Watch your fingers!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501532","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"care (close attention"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Ese era mi dedo.","en":"That was my finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800022","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Me acabo de cortar el dedo.","en":"I just cut my finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455288","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"synonym of acabamiento"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to cut"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"No siento mis dedos del pie.","en":"I can't feel my toes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454102","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"foot"}]},{"text":"No me señales con el dedo.","en":"Don't point your finger at me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519143","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"sign","l":"señal"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}